{"id":"630528","name":"青椒鸡肉馅饺子","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630528/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"2块"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"4个"},{"name":"饺子粉","amount":"450克"}],"sub":[{"name":"菜汁","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：鸡胸肉（已清洗）、青椒（已去蒂去籽清洗）、饺子粉、菜汁。","img":"images/630528/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将鸡胸肉和青椒放在案板上分别切开。","img":"images/630528/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入绞肉机里。","img":"images/630528/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"绞成泥。","img":"images/630528/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入大碗里。","img":"images/630528/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"随后，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/630528/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的蚝油。","img":"images/630528/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/630528/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"调味拌匀成饺子馅。","img":"images/630528/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"接着，在大盆里倒入450克饺子粉。","img":"images/630528/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"逐步倒入菜汁。","img":"images/630528/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"和成面团。","img":"images/630528/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盖上盖醒上20分钟。","img":"images/630528/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"然后，在硅胶垫上撒上适量的干面粉，放上和好的面团搓成长条。","img":"images/630528/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"下剂子。","img":"images/630528/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"擀成饺子皮。","img":"images/630528/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"取擀好的皮子放上馅料包好。","img":"images/630528/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"包好的饺子。","img":"images/630528/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"最后，将包好的饺子下入沸水中煮开煮上5分钟即可。","img":"images/630528/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}